{
  "rate": 48000,
  "groups": 10,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "group": "G01",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.265,
      "planned_seconds": 5,
      "speech_seconds": 4.095,
      "chars": 18,
      "chars_per_second": 4.4,
      "text": "它在这里站了五百多年，美得让人不敢呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "group": "G01",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.44,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.27,
      "chars": 22,
      "chars_per_second": 4.17,
      "text": "1950年夏夜，一个二十一岁的僧人，把它烧成了灰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "group": "G01",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.555,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.385,
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 3.71,
      "text": "金阁寺本名鹿苑寺，1397年由足利义满建造。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.5,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.33,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.56,
      "text": "三层楼阁贴满金箔，整座建筑倒映在镜湖池里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 6.44,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 6.27,
      "chars": 18,
      "chars_per_second": 2.87,
      "text": "春天樱花，冬天白雪，人们说，这就是日本的美。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "group": "G02",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 6.08,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.91,
      "chars": 18,
      "chars_per_second": 3.05,
      "text": "夏夜，萤火点点，僧人站在池边，久久望着金阁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.565,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.395,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.52,
      "text": "他叫林养贤，1929年生在京都北边的舞鹤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 6.415,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 6.245,
      "chars": 21,
      "chars_per_second": 3.36,
      "text": "家里是一座小寺院。他从小就口吃，一开口就被嘲笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "group": "G03",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.59,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.42,
      "chars": 21,
      "chars_per_second": 3.87,
      "text": "父亲病逝后，十六岁的他被送进金阁寺，成了见习僧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "group": "G04",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.055,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 3.885,
      "chars": 17,
      "chars_per_second": 4.38,
      "text": "他仰头看着金阁的屋脊，眼睛里全是金光。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "group": "G04",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.45,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.28,
      "chars": 17,
      "chars_per_second": 3.97,
      "text": "他一边在寺里修行，一边在大谷大学读书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "group": "G04",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 3.135,
      "planned_seconds": 5,
      "speech_seconds": 2.965,
      "chars": 14,
      "chars_per_second": 4.72,
      "text": "可口吃让他在人群里越来越沉默。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.755,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.585,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.4,
      "text": "战后的金阁寺，游客排队买票，寺院靠门票赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.58,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.41,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.51,
      "text": "他看不惯这些。他和住持之间，也慢慢有了隔阂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "group": "G05",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.655,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.485,
      "chars": 21,
      "chars_per_second": 3.83,
      "text": "1950年7月1日深夜，他提着旧布包，走过回廊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "group": "G06",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.74,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.57,
      "chars": 16,
      "chars_per_second": 3.5,
      "text": "金阁里面，佛像静静坐着，烛火轻轻摇晃。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "group": "G06",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 6.14,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.97,
      "chars": 21,
      "chars_per_second": 3.52,
      "text": "凌晨三点，窗口亮起一点火，接着，整座楼阁烧了起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "group": "G06",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.67,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.5,
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 3.64,
      "text": "镜湖池里，燃烧的金阁倒映在水中，像另一片星空。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.625,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.455,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 4.26,
      "text": "没有人员伤亡。可是火起的时候，警报器没有响。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.89,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.72,
      "chars": 22,
      "chars_per_second": 3.85,
      "text": "屋顶塌了，五百年的国宝和足利义满的木像，全成了灰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "group": "G07",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.615,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.445,
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 3.67,
      "text": "天亮以后，废墟还在冒烟，焦黑的木头立在晨光里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 6.63,
      "planned_seconds": 8,
      "speech_seconds": 6.46,
      "chars": 25,
      "chars_per_second": 3.87,
      "text": "那天傍晚，警方在后山找到了他。他也曾想过结束自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.66,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.49,
      "chars": 16,
      "chars_per_second": 3.56,
      "text": "审讯室里，他低着头说，他嫉妒金阁的美。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "group": "G08",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.35,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.18,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.67,
      "text": "有时又说，他厌恶寺院里的钱味。供词前后不一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.91,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.74,
      "chars": 20,
      "chars_per_second": 4.22,
      "text": "事发后，母亲被叫到京都。她一直盼着儿子当住持。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 4.835,
      "planned_seconds": 5,
      "speech_seconds": 4.665,
      "chars": 16,
      "chars_per_second": 3.43,
      "text": "她没能见到儿子。回程的火车上，她走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "group": "G09",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 4.735,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 4.565,
      "chars": 18,
      "chars_per_second": 3.94,
      "text": "1950年12月，京都地方法院判他七年。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 5.98,
      "planned_seconds": 7,
      "speech_seconds": 5.81,
      "chars": 22,
      "chars_per_second": 3.79,
      "text": "狱中，他的肺结核和精神疾病越来越重，后来提前获释。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut": "silence",
      "audio_seconds": 6.03,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.86,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.24,
      "text": "1955年，金阁重建，金光又一次洒满镜湖池。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "group": "G10",
      "cut": "tail",
      "audio_seconds": 5.64,
      "planned_seconds": 6,
      "speech_seconds": 5.47,
      "chars": 19,
      "chars_per_second": 3.47,
      "text": "三岛由纪夫写下了《金阁寺》。美，究竟该如何守护？"
    }
  ],
  "total_speech_seconds": 155.83
}
